stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Requested
  Requested --> Warm : ambil dari pool
  Warm --> Running : prompt pertama
  Running --> Waiting : canUseTool
  Waiting --> Running : approve / deny
  Running --> Idle : turn selesai
  Idle --> Running : prompt baru
  Idle --> Suspended : idle lewat batas
  Suspended --> Running : resume session_id
  Suspended --> Reclaimed : TTL habis
  Reclaimed --> [*]
